/*!
    \page still-renders.html
    \title The Run Continues
    \brief A page that renders after the module page's render failure.

    This page exists to prove that a single-exec run keeps going after a
    failed page: the generator reports the failure, skips that page, and
    the rest of the run still reaches the output directory.
*/
